## Mode Comparison Matrix

| Feature | Ask Mode | Agent Mode | Plan Mode |
|---------|----------|-----------|-----------|
| **File reads** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes |
| **Code search** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes |
| **Shell execution** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **File writes** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **Delete files** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **Spawn subagents** | ❌ No | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **Web search** | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes |
| **Presents options** | ⚠️ Limited | ❌ No (acts directly) | ✅ Yes |
| **Asks before acting** | N/A | Sometimes | ✅ Always |
| **Best for** | Research | Implementation | Strategy |

