## Mode Switching

### How to Switch Between Modes

**Via UI Toggle**:
- The mode selector in the Composer panel dropdown
- Click the mode name (Ask / Plan / Agent) to switch

**Via Keyboard Shortcut**:
```
Ctrl+Shift+P (Cmd+Shift+P on macOS) → "Cursor: Switch to [Mode] Mode"
```

**Via Slash Command**:
```
/ask      → Switch to Ask mode
/plan     → Switch to Plan mode
/agent    → Switch to Agent mode (default)
```

**Via Settings**:
```json
{
  "cursor.agent.defaultMode": "agent" // "ask", "agent", "plan"
}
```

### Mode Persistence

| Scope | How It Works |
|-------|-------------|
| **Session-level** | Mode persists within a Composer session |
| **New session** | Resets to `cursor.agent.defaultMode` |
| **Workspace-level** | Can be set in `.vscode/settings.json` |
| **User-level** | Set in user settings, applies to all workspaces |

