## Mode-Specific Autonomy

### What Decisions Are Autonomous Per Mode

| Decision | Ask Mode | Plan Mode | Agent Mode |
|----------|----------|-----------|-----------|
| **Read files** | ✅ Always | ✅ Always | ✅ Always |
| **Search code** | ✅ Always | ✅ Always | ✅ Always |
| **Explain code** | ✅ Always | ✅ Always | ✅ Always |
| **Present options** | ⚠️ Limited | ✅ Always | ❌ N/A |
| **Recommend approach** | ❌ No | ✅ Always | ⚠️ Sometimes |
| **Ask before changes** | N/A | ✅ Always | ⚠️ For risky ops |
| **Execute changes** | ❌ No | ❌ No | ✅ With approval |
| **Spawn subagents** | ❌ No | ❌ No | ✅ Always |
| **Run shell commands** | ❌ No | ❌ No | ✅ With approval |

### Approval Levels in Agent Mode

| Action Type | Approval Required |
|------------|------------------|
| **Read files** | None (always allowed) |
| **Grep/Search** | None (always allowed) |
| **Single file edit** | Output visible to user |
| **Multiple file edits** | Agent shows diff for review |
| **Shell commands** | May ask for confirmation |
| **Delete files** | Always asks |
| **Security-sensitive** | Always asks |
| **Infrastructure changes** | Always asks |

