## Relationship to Subagent Launch

### Mode-Aware Subagent Spawning

When the main agent spawns a subagent, the subagent inherits the parent's mode constraints:

| Parent Mode | Subagent Mode | Subagent Capabilities |
|------------|---------------|----------------------|
| **Ask** | Read-only subagent | explore subagent only |
| **Plan** | Analysis subagent | explore, ci-investigator |
| **Agent** | Full subagent | All subagent types |

### Example: Ask Mode with explore Subagent

```
User (Ask Mode): "Explore the database layer"
Agent (Ask Mode): Spawns explore subagent
Subagent: Finds all DB-related files, reports findings
Agent: Presents findings to user (no file changes)
```

