## Troubleshooting Mode Issues

### Common Problems

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Agent making changes in Plan Mode | Mode not actually Plan | Verify mode selector shows "Plan" |
| Agent not executing in Agent Mode | Auto-approve disabled | Check `cursor.agent.autoApprove` |
| Ask Mode returning limited results | Read-only constraints | Agent can only explain, not modify |
| Plan Mode presenting wrong options | Missing context | Add @-references for relevant code |
| Mode not persisting | Session reset | Set `cursor.agent.defaultMode` in settings |

